(c) $\varepsilon_j\le c\alpha\eta_jr_j\sigma_j^\mu$ and $\varepsilon_j\le ch_jr_j$;
(d) $h_j\le\alpha/(2K_j^{\tau+1})$ and $h_{j+1}\le h_j/4$;
(e) $\sigma_j^{-n}e^{-K_j\sigma_j/2}\le E_j$;
