$$\sum_{j\ge0}(r_j+\sigma_j)E_j\le4(r_0+\sigma_0)E_0,\qquad \sum_{j\ge0}E_j\le2E_0,\qquad \sum_{j\ge0}2^jE_j\le2E_0,\qquad \sum_{j\ge0}\frac{\varepsilon_j}{r_jh_j}\le\frac43\frac{\alpha E_0\sigma_0^\mu}{h_0}.$$
